            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3029",
            "content": {
                "en": "Uh... I’m not sure either, but it should be somewhere near the Qiqiao Festival grounds.",
                "zh": "呃，我也不认得，但应该是在乞巧大会会场附近吧。",
                "ja": ""
