        },
        {
            "id": "b67e4d5b-dc7e-4f66-abb0-f86de173ef9e",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3030",
            "content": {
                "en": "Um... my head was a mess just now. Thanks for telling me what was happening on the plane.",
                "zh": "那个......刚才我脑子有点乱，谢谢你告诉我飞机上的事。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 920.0,
            "positionY": 8.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "04444b97-6862-424d-87dd-3c2b5cbb1081",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3031",
            "content": {
                "en": "Me too. And thank you for getting me out of there.",
                "zh": "我也是，谢谢你带我离开那里。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1250.0,
            "positionY": 8.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "92f70190-ec84-4e71-b7e7-e26febced394",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_4005",
            "content": {
                "en": "From what you’ve said, I can’t just abandon the people on that plane. Let’s part ways here.",
                "zh": "嗯，听你的说法，我不能放着飞机上的人不管，我们就在这里分别吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1576.0,
            "positionY": 6.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
